# Per-suite virtualenvs and caches
**/.venv/
**/node_modules/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.egg-info/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.vitest-cache/
**/coverage/
**/.coverage
**/htmlcov/

# Bench reports — keep folder, drop contents except a baseline.json checked in by humans
**/reports/*
!**/reports/.gitkeep
!**/reports/baseline.json
backend/reports/requests_raw.csv
backend/reports/percentiles.csv
